OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 18 APR
OL,4,G0630FBreakfast
OL,5,     GAl Ryan presents Radio 3's
OL,6,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,7,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,8,G0900FSaturday Morning
OL,9,     GTom Service with the perfect
OL,10,     Gclassical soundtrack for the
OL,11,     Gweekend. With an exclusive
OL,12,     Gsession from violinist Alena
OL,13,     GBaeva, plus harpist Lavinia
OL,14,     GMeijer chats about her new album.
OL,15,G1200FEarlier... with Jools Holland
OL,16,     GJools is joined by architectural
OL,17,     Ghistorian Sir Charles Saumarez
OL,18,     GSmith to explore the life and
OL,19,     Gwork of 18th-century architect
OL,20,     Gand playwright John Vanbrugh, who
OL,21,     Gdied 300 years ago.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
