OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 18 APR
OL,4,G1300FKey Changes: Radio 3's Essential
OL,5,     FHistory of Classical Music
OL,6,     GThe year is 1182. Notre-Dame de
OL,7,     GParis is consecrated, and new
OL,8,     Gmusical ideas are born.
OL,9,G1400FRecord Review
OL,10,     GAndrew McGregor with the best new
OL,11,     Gclassical releases, joined by
OL,12,     GJoseph McHardy and Yshani
OL,13,     GPerinpanayagam, who chooses her
OL,14,     Gfavourite recording of
OL,15,     GShostakovich's Symphony No. 9.
OL,16,G1600FSound of Cinema
OL,17,     GJoin Edith Bowman for a
OL,18,     Gsoundtrack-rich journey through
OL,19,     Gworlds of fairytales and fantasy,
OL,20,     Gwith composer Nitin Sawhney on
OL,21,     Gthe Lord of the Rings, and actor
OL,22,     Gand musician Jeff Goldblum.
