OL,4,G1700FThis Classical Life
OL,5,     GJess Gillam swaps music choices
OL,6,     Gwith cellist Sterling Elliott.
OL,7,G1800FOpera on 3
OL,8,     GLive from the Metropolitan Opera
OL,9,     Gin New York, Kaija Saariaho's
OL,10,     GInnocence starring Vilma Jaa as
OL,11,     Gthe grieving mother and Joyce
OL,12,     GDiDonato as the Waitress. Susanna
OL,13,     GMalkki conducts.
OL,14,G2015FDavid Bednall: St Mark Passion
OL,15,     GThe BBC Singers give the world
OL,16,     Gpremiere of a dramatic setting of
OL,17,     Gthe passion story as told in the
OL,18,     GGospel of St Mark.
